      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DREAMALITTLEDREAM NZ (5) has been excellent of late and she made it two in a row when successful at her latest appearance over 1660m at this track, getting home by a neck. Good enough to take out a race like this. BUBBY TO BASE (8) went well to finish second two starts ago then registered an effortless victory last start, scoring by 7 metres over 1660m at this track. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Tackles a similar assignment and she can make it two on the trot. LULLABY NZ (1) must be considered after she finished third over 1660m at this track a week ago. SWEET AGENDA (2) should not have any excuses from the favourable draw. Include in exotic bets.",
